WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.191
A shared view depends on other database objects.

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:09.224
This query uses information schema metadata to show which tables feed each view.

00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:17.774
Dependency awareness matters because changing a base object or shared view can affect several downstream consumers.

00:00:17.774 --> 00:00:22.263
Before making a breaking change, understand the dependency chain.
